/*
 * Dispatches instruction expressions to the appropriate semantic-validation
 * module.
 *
 * Instruction expressions(`InstructionExpr`) represent control-flow and
 * statement-level constructs in the Ymir language:
 *
 *   - assertions,
 *   - variable declarations,
 *   - pattern-based declarations,
 *   - break / continue,
 *   - return / throw / yield,
 *   - panic,
 *   - other statement-level constructs.
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::instruction
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/instruction.yr
 * @Author(s):
